```sql
--Description: We want to know how much gas‑fee revenue every miner has earned.
--            • A transaction’s sender pays a fee equal to receipt_gas_used * gas_price.
--            • That fee is credited to the miner of the block containing the transaction.
--            • Therefore, join TRANSACTIONS to BLOCKS on block_number and sum the
--              product (receipt_gas_used * gas_price) for each miner.
--            • Filter out rows where either multiplicand is NULL to avoid null maths.
--            • Return miners ranked by cumulative fee (Wei); show top 20 for inspection.
SELECT
       b."miner",
